WEBVTT

00:17.330 --> 00:18.830
GHOST BUSTERZ!

00:17.710 --> 00:20.460
OH! The time has come

00:18.250 --> 00:18.830
BUSTERZ!

00:20.460 --> 00:23.840
To stand up for tomorrow

00:22.790 --> 00:24.250
OH OH OH!

00:23.840 --> 00:26.420
We're ghostbusterz

00:25.710 --> 00:27.220
OH OH OH!

00:26.420 --> 00:31.050
Breakin' away from the old ghosts

00:31.050 --> 00:34.430
Of history

00:34.430 --> 00:37.810
Breaking free!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

01:03.880 --> 01:05.380
GHOST BUSTERZ!

01:04.250 --> 01:07.010
OH! The time has come

01:04.790 --> 01:05.380
BUSTERZ!

01:07.010 --> 01:10.470
To stand up for tomorrow

01:09.340 --> 01:10.800
OH OH OH!

01:10.470 --> 01:13.300
We're ghostbusterz

01:12.260 --> 01:13.760
OH OH OH!

01:13.300 --> 01:17.100
No fear for anything in our way!

01:15.560 --> 01:17.060
GHOST BUSTERZ!

01:15.640 --> 01:20.440
Presented by Strelizia subs

01:16.470 --> 01:17.060
BUSTERZ!

01:17.100 --> 01:18.640
The time has come

01:18.390 --> 01:19.890
GHOST BUSTERZ!

01:32.820 --> 01:37.040
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.410 --> 01:41.210
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.210 --> 01:48.130
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.130 --> 01:51.300
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.300 --> 01:56.390
At the same time, beings seeking to end the period of turbulence

01:56.390 --> 02:00.270
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.270 --> 02:04.520
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.520 --> 02:06.520
And then...

02:06.520 --> 02:10.280
On the fifteenth day of the ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:10.280 --> 02:12.740
the Eastern Army of Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:12.740 --> 02:17.870
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:17.870 --> 02:21.330
As a result of the performance of Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.330 --> 02:27.250
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.250 --> 02:33.510
bringing what should have been
three hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.340 --> 02:39.390
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:43.910 --> 02:47.920
WIND

02:43.910 --> 02:47.920
FOREST

02:43.910 --> 02:47.920
FIRE

02:43.910 --> 02:47.920
MOUNTAIN

02:56.760 --> 02:58.320
Demons again?

03:07.480 --> 03:10.150
Stop being a slob and get out here!

03:16.320 --> 03:19.550
Musashi, this ayakashi looks really powerful.

03:22.880 --> 03:25.190
Is that you, Musashi?

03:25.400 --> 03:29.440
Musashi, this ayakashi is different.

03:30.000 --> 03:30.910
How can you tell?

03:31.600 --> 03:34.190
Princess Yume, different how?

03:35.000 --> 03:37.960
I feel he has a human soul.

03:38.160 --> 03:43.630
I am the Lord of the country of Kai,
<i>Minamoto no Harunobu</i>, Shingen Takeda.

03:44.480 --> 03:48.160
Shingen Takeda has been
dead for over thirty years!

03:48.320 --> 03:49.750
Maybe it's a clone.

03:50.160 --> 03:53.790
I was resurrected after a thirty-year sleep!

03:54.760 --> 03:56.470
- What did he say?
- Here he comes!

03:57.240 --> 04:00.950
I'm here to kill a boy named Musashi!

04:01.160 --> 04:04.440
Master Musashi, it's a giant tiger!

04:38.600 --> 04:41.240
SUNKEN CASTLE

05:02.360 --> 05:03.480
Musashi!

05:09.520 --> 05:11.350
Master Musashi, I'm coming!

05:21.640 --> 05:23.920
Yay, I hit him!

05:31.040 --> 05:33.400
Musashi! Run!

05:34.640 --> 05:36.790
My body refuses to move.

05:46.400 --> 05:48.990
Get out of my sight, bastard!

05:54.360 --> 05:55.480
What?

06:01.520 --> 06:02.640
Musashi!

06:06.400 --> 06:07.470
They disappeared!

06:07.640 --> 06:08.990
Musashi...

06:09.160 --> 06:10.430
Master Musashi!

06:27.480 --> 06:29.360
Where am I?

06:33.000 --> 06:34.350
I see you!

06:46.400 --> 06:48.150
You will pay for this!

06:50.360 --> 06:56.110
Tell me, Shingen, is it because of
you that we are in this place?

06:56.320 --> 06:57.670
Indeed.

06:58.160 --> 07:02.120
It is a parallel space where
we can fight each other.

07:02.560 --> 07:05.120
Nobody will bother us here.

07:05.320 --> 07:09.440
They don't bother me,
they are my friends!

07:09.600 --> 07:12.070
Let me return to them now!

07:12.560 --> 07:16.030
Only if you can beat me.

07:16.200 --> 07:19.030
But, unfortunately for you,
you are not able to.

07:19.240 --> 07:20.990
You've got to be kidding!

07:22.600 --> 07:24.270
Musashi, where are you?

07:24.800 --> 07:29.750
The slimy ayakashi took him somewhere else.

07:30.160 --> 07:33.870
No, Musashi is close to us.

07:34.480 --> 07:37.950
I feel his presence.

07:41.280 --> 07:43.720
My sword always detects ayakashi.

07:43.920 --> 07:45.120
But where?

07:45.320 --> 07:49.790
In a space outside our world.

07:49.960 --> 07:52.920
Musashi is fighting there.

07:54.080 --> 07:55.430
Flammable bullets!

08:12.280 --> 08:13.870
It's useless.

08:14.040 --> 08:17.870
You are not capable of beating me.

08:21.840 --> 08:23.190
What makes you so sure?

08:23.480 --> 08:24.960
Would you like to know?

08:25.640 --> 08:27.040
Obviously!

08:27.200 --> 08:28.630
Very well.

08:28.800 --> 08:31.920
I like to taunt my enemies.

08:32.480 --> 08:36.870
Musashi, you don't know how
to use the demon gun properly.

08:37.560 --> 08:38.880
What?

08:39.440 --> 08:42.270
You still need to improve
your physical strength.

08:42.800 --> 08:46.320
Then, the demon gun will respond.

08:46.520 --> 08:48.320
My physical strength?

08:48.920 --> 08:52.990
Then you will no longer be
dominated by the gun demon.

08:53.440 --> 08:58.990
Shingen, you know a lot about this gun!

08:59.200 --> 09:01.430
- Yes.
- How?

09:02.080 --> 09:06.390
It doesn't matter, you're not even
worthy of being killed by me.

09:06.560 --> 09:09.840
Try to get stronger for when we meet again.

09:17.440 --> 09:18.560
Musashi!

09:18.720 --> 09:20.950
- Master Musashi!
- Are you ok?

09:21.120 --> 09:22.600
I'm feeling well.

09:22.760 --> 09:24.240
Where is the ayakashi?

09:24.440 --> 09:27.190
The sword no longer detects his presence.

09:28.120 --> 09:29.920
He disappeared.

09:30.760 --> 09:32.800
So, did you win?

09:32.960 --> 09:34.470
No.

09:35.080 --> 09:36.910
He mocked me.

09:37.080 --> 09:39.830
He left me alive because I am too weak.

09:42.480 --> 09:45.600
Was the ayakashi really Shingen Takeda?

09:46.520 --> 09:47.560
Perhaps.

09:48.080 --> 09:50.830
I have never been more humiliated.

09:51.000 --> 09:54.520
I will win against that corpse next time!

10:06.000 --> 10:07.320
I have returned!

10:07.800 --> 10:11.000
Welcome back, Lord Shingen Takeda.

10:12.000 --> 10:14.880
I'm hungry!
Where are the rice cakes?

10:15.040 --> 10:17.430
They are all ready.

10:18.000 --> 10:19.430
Do things right.

10:21.640 --> 10:23.920
Is Musashi dead?

10:24.440 --> 10:25.640
Who are you?

10:25.800 --> 10:29.950
It's been so long, Shingen Takeda,
I mean, Harunobu.

10:30.160 --> 10:33.440
Easily twenty years, maybe more.

10:33.640 --> 10:35.950
I don't know you, monster.

10:36.160 --> 10:39.440
It's me, Ieyasu Tokugawa.

10:44.400 --> 10:48.390
Are you Ieyasu?
You changed a lot.

10:48.600 --> 10:50.350
You too, Harunobu.

10:52.440 --> 10:54.240
So what about Musashi?

10:54.400 --> 10:57.680
I spared him and let him escape.

10:57.840 --> 11:01.040
Why did you do that?

11:01.760 --> 11:08.240
Ieyasu, do you think you can criticize me?

11:08.400 --> 11:12.310
I have known you since
you were in diapers.

11:22.920 --> 11:26.800
Why did you resurrect his soul?

11:26.960 --> 11:31.720
I have always hated Shingen Takeda!

11:33.160 --> 11:35.150
Please forgive me.

11:35.720 --> 11:43.830
But to kill Musashi, it's better to harness
the emotions of a great war leader.

11:45.000 --> 11:50.600
I was glad to be free of one of my enemies.

11:50.760 --> 11:53.150
And what do you do?
You revived him!

11:53.320 --> 11:56.390
I bet Leonardo da Vinci took part in that!

11:57.120 --> 12:00.480
Yes, thanks to his scientific genius...

12:00.640 --> 12:07.070
we managed to resurrect a great
leader and fuse him with an ayakashi.

12:07.240 --> 12:10.950
I will not calm down before I talk to him!

12:11.120 --> 12:13.080
Where is Leonardo da Vinci?

12:28.760 --> 12:29.990
Lord da Vinci.

12:30.600 --> 12:31.950
What is that?

12:33.320 --> 12:35.910
There's my hippopotamus friend again!

12:36.120 --> 12:38.920
Hippopotamus friend?

12:39.400 --> 12:41.390
But look, it looks strong, doesn't it?

12:41.560 --> 12:46.590
What is this thing that
looks like a carnival float?

12:47.640 --> 12:50.630
It is a Rasetsu, my latest invention.

12:50.800 --> 12:51.840
Rasetsu?

12:52.040 --> 12:58.840
It also has built-in radar to detect artifacts.

12:59.560 --> 13:04.800
This radar is more effective than Musashi's.

13:05.440 --> 13:10.990
In short, you will be able to
find the hidden artifacts...

13:11.160 --> 13:13.600
faster than Musashi and his friends.

13:13.760 --> 13:17.590
And as you can see, it is very strong!

13:19.240 --> 13:21.750
What are your intentions, though?

13:21.920 --> 13:28.750
On one hand, you act like our ally and on the
other, you give Musashi the artifact map.

13:28.960 --> 13:31.550
It is not a map, it is a radar.

13:32.000 --> 13:36.390
That's not important!
In any case, you cannot be trusted!

13:36.560 --> 13:39.710
Ieyasu, you are not very smart.

13:39.920 --> 13:45.750
No wonder the Toyotomi have
taken power in this world.

13:45.920 --> 13:47.150
What did you say?

13:47.560 --> 13:55.630
Artifacts are objects that the Yin-Yang
monks developed to imprison the ayakashi.

13:55.800 --> 13:59.030
That means they
are secured very well...

13:59.200 --> 14:05.080
with powerful traps and other
protections against ayakashi.

14:05.240 --> 14:11.430
Does that mean we will let them
find them first to steal them later?

14:11.960 --> 14:13.390
Exactly.

14:15.920 --> 14:18.070
You're a genius, Lord da Vinci.

14:22.280 --> 14:24.320
Wait for me!

14:24.520 --> 14:28.310
Is there really a castle at the
bottom of the mountains?

14:29.400 --> 14:35.360
The map Dabinoji gave us indicates
that the castle is around here.

14:36.160 --> 14:37.510
So there has to be one.

14:59.760 --> 15:04.440
According to the map, the castle
where the artifact is located is nearby.

15:05.280 --> 15:06.510
Let's hurry!

15:08.240 --> 15:11.310
If you are gonna slow us down, stay here.

15:16.160 --> 15:18.600
I will follow you wherever you go!

15:20.280 --> 15:23.030
Don't stop so suddenly!

15:24.120 --> 15:26.000
What's the matter with you people?

15:26.800 --> 15:27.950
What is that?

15:45.460 --> 15:49.010
The seventh and final castle
must be around here.

15:49.220 --> 15:57.860
Congratulations, sister! If we get the
artifacts, we can imprison all the ayakashi!

15:59.300 --> 16:01.970
- Probably
- Has Princess Kaguya returned?

16:02.380 --> 16:04.100
Mitsunari, look!

16:04.260 --> 16:07.220
The map for the legendary artifacts!

16:10.140 --> 16:16.090
With the seven artifacts, there will
be no more need to lock up Yume.

16:16.660 --> 16:18.410
Right, Mitsunari?

16:19.300 --> 16:21.370
Speaking of that...

16:21.940 --> 16:26.820
Neither Yume nor I have any
intention of marrying an ayakashi.

16:27.380 --> 16:31.290
There is nothing to fear about that.

16:31.700 --> 16:35.770
Is Princess Yume really safe?

16:36.380 --> 16:40.740
Yukimura Sanada must have
told you about it already.

16:40.900 --> 16:46.780
Musashi Miyamoto is with her,
she couldn't be safer.

16:46.980 --> 16:49.810
But this famous Musashi is a thief.

16:49.980 --> 16:53.740
How can I trust him?

16:53.940 --> 16:58.170
Lord Mitsunari, the princess
assures you that she is safe.

16:59.180 --> 17:01.170
I beg your forgiveness.

17:25.900 --> 17:29.020
The first artifact is in this castle.

17:35.540 --> 17:37.930
It is completely submerged.

17:38.100 --> 17:40.900
Why is the castle submerged?

17:41.100 --> 17:43.540
That doesn't matter.

17:43.700 --> 17:48.900
What is important is that inside,
somewhere, a treasure is hidden.

18:04.020 --> 18:08.250
The treasure seems to be
hidden deep in the castle.

18:08.460 --> 18:11.050
And it looks pretty deep.

18:11.220 --> 18:13.260
You can't really get there fast.

18:14.300 --> 18:16.180
What can we do about that?

18:16.700 --> 18:20.460
I don't know, that's exactly
why I like to rob castles!

18:20.620 --> 18:22.360
Musashi, you seem amused.

18:22.420 --> 18:23.740
Obviously!

18:24.380 --> 18:28.210
We have to swim to the castle first.

18:28.380 --> 18:30.530
If that's so, leave it to me!

18:30.700 --> 18:32.500
Is that a ninja tool?

18:32.660 --> 18:34.220
It's an aquatic spider!

18:34.420 --> 18:37.170
Amazing, you'd think you were a ninja!

18:37.380 --> 18:40.130
I am an authentic ninja!

18:40.340 --> 18:41.610
Is that so?

18:46.740 --> 18:47.970
Honestly...

18:48.140 --> 18:51.530
We know it won't work,
however it doesn't hurt to try.

18:52.500 --> 18:55.570
He's walking on water!

18:56.180 --> 18:58.760
Amazing, Ninjahappyakurokujuhachigo!

18:59.140 --> 19:02.420
No! I have had enough!

19:04.660 --> 19:07.570
That's nothing, I can continue swimming.

19:22.340 --> 19:26.020
When you get to the roof,
I'll throw you a rope!

19:26.460 --> 19:27.860
Very well!

19:29.980 --> 19:31.730
Ayakashi?

19:31.940 --> 19:34.090
No, I don't think so.

19:54.500 --> 19:57.890
Take it easy, Ninjataro, it's just paper!

19:58.100 --> 19:59.850
Paper?
From shikigami?

20:00.020 --> 20:00.930
Shikigami?

20:01.100 --> 20:03.460
Emissaries of the Yin-Yang monks.

20:03.620 --> 20:06.900
Against Yin-Yang,
we use Yin-Yang!

20:08.300 --> 20:10.860
<i>Nenken Meiretsu</i>!
Give me your strength!

20:11.380 --> 20:13.820
Ronin! Wait!

20:14.020 --> 20:16.820
Master Ronin, do something now!

20:17.020 --> 20:19.770
Ronin, don't do anything!

20:19.980 --> 20:22.210
Hurry, help!

20:40.660 --> 20:42.540
I really thought I was going to die!

20:42.700 --> 20:46.660
Ronin, give me an warning before
trying to electrocute me!

20:47.260 --> 20:49.010
My bad!

20:49.220 --> 20:50.570
That was a close call!

20:59.460 --> 21:02.770
Musashi, Ronin, do your best!

21:04.540 --> 21:08.370
Ninjataro, if you see
something abnormal, run!

21:09.140 --> 21:10.290
Very well!

21:14.500 --> 21:17.730
Do you think there will be other
traps besides the shikigami?

21:17.900 --> 21:21.500
We shall see.
We will fight whatever comes.

21:29.060 --> 21:30.330
Let's go!

22:24.540 --> 22:26.530
I hope Musashi is all right.

22:30.500 --> 22:31.900
What's going on?

22:32.460 --> 22:34.850
Musashi, Ronin...

23:04.140 --> 23:05.020
Ronin!

23:05.660 --> 23:06.980
Where is the artifact?

23:07.500 --> 23:09.970
Doesn't matter
Musashi is in danger!

23:10.780 --> 23:12.900
What happened to him?

23:14.020 --> 23:15.900
An enormous monster attacked us!

23:16.620 --> 23:20.690
If we don't help, he will drown
at the bottom of the lake!

23:21.420 --> 23:23.330
An enormous monster?

23:23.500 --> 23:25.460
Another shikigami?

23:25.620 --> 23:27.450
- No!
- An ayakashi?

23:27.620 --> 23:30.850
Neither.

23:31.020 --> 23:32.820
It's a mechanical puppet!

24:00.010 --> 24:02.760
In my natural, unadorned style,

24:02.760 --> 24:05.600
I'll tell you these feelings of mine

24:05.600 --> 24:10.940
Together to the sky past the darkness!

24:10.940 --> 24:16.070
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

24:17.610 --> 24:22.740
Baby, we'll send time flowing forward just a little,

24:22.740 --> 24:28.920
and we'll embrace even the harsh gusts of wind

24:28.920 --> 24:34.250
with sympathy for pointless worries

24:34.250 --> 24:38.380
and a melody that will overcome the pain

24:40.760 --> 24:51.150
If the poison of the flower that bloomed in my cupped hands

24:51.150 --> 25:02.070
has managed to pierce through the center of my heart...

25:02.070 --> 25:04.830
In my natural, unadorned style,

25:04.830 --> 25:07.700
I'll tell you these feelings of mine,

25:07.700 --> 25:13.290
Unraveling this puzzle of the heart

25:13.290 --> 25:16.050
I'll bring out every part

25:16.050 --> 25:19.050
of your unchanging style

25:19.050 --> 25:24.350
Together to the sky past the darkness!

25:24.350 --> 25:29.520
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

25:31.380 --> 25:34.370
I don't believe it!
That woman again?

25:34.540 --> 25:39.500
I don't have time to waste,
I have to find the artifacts!

25:39.660 --> 25:43.780
The next chapter: <i>That Woman Again</i>!
